    "collector": "Keep the pantry stocked. Choose safe foraging when enemies threaten the routes; choose bold foraging when supplies run low and routes are clear. A full basket returns home automatically. Relax when supplies are plentiful or you need recovery. The visible automatic-needs rule gets food when your hunger is low; your decision controls the longer-term job, not each meal.",
